# icmp-pulse-server router keys (default path /etc/icmp-pulse/keys).
# Readable by the service user only: chmod 600.
# One router per line: key (64 hex characters) and an optional label (no spaces).
# Generate a key on the router with: icmp-pulse --genkey
#
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef shop-krakow
